# The testers who may open the site while its guard is on, the emergency switch of the open
# alpha (ADR 0023). One line per tester: `<username> <argon2id hash>`; docs/staging.md says how
# to make a hash. `scripts/tester-guard.sh` turns these lines into the guard Caddy imports.
# Without a credential line the guard stays off and the site open.
